  "prefLabel": "Env-C 214.02 Applicability; Exclusions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 214.02 Applicability; Exclusions.\n\n(a) These rules shall apply to any person required or allowed to submit documents electronically to the department, whether for use by the department or EPA, to satisfy any requirement of 40 CFR for an authorized NH program.\n\n(b) These rules shall not apply to documents submitted via fax or via magnetic or optical media such as diskette, compact disc, digital video disc, or tape.\n\nSource. #12880, eff 9-30-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-c200.html"
}
